xNDY1Nw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/events/911014657","actor":{"login":"rosenfeld","id":32246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld","html_url":"https://github.com/rosenfeld","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-01-04T10:48:18Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/270347324","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/27480#issuecomment-270347324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/27480","id":270347324,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MDM0NzMyNA==","user":{"login":"rosenfeld","id":32246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld","html_url":"https://github.com/rosenfeld","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-01-04T11:07:23Z","updated_at":"2017-01-04T11:07:23Z","body":"Thanks for the information, @pixeltrix. I guessed so, but I didn't mind checking because I didn't see it explicitly documented in either of the render* methods API documentation and I was afraid it could happen the same in the future, so I ended up assigning it in the controller itself... I wasn't happy either with setting the instance variable in `:locals` but I don't think `:local_assigns` used to exist before. I remember only seeing references to it in recent changelogs. I only see brief mentions to `:local_assigns` in the Rendering Guide and in the ActionView::Base API docs.\r\n\r\nI just guessed it wasn't an intentional change, that's why I reported. I agree that setting instance variables in `:locals` is bad practice but since some people were using this before `:local_assigns` was introduced, maybe it might be a good idea to warn some deprecation note on this usage, recommending `:local_assigns` instead before removing support for instance variables in `:locals` so that users would have some time to fix it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/270347324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rosenfeld","id":32246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld","html_url":"https://github.